  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Communities to secure rights and livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  project will develop rural communities where women, men and children to enjoy their human rights, have secure livelihoods and  participate actively in their own development.  It will work with women, men, youth and children to provide quality education in a safe environment, develop livelihood opportunities, prevent SGBV and FGM and support survivors, promote sexual and reproducite health and rights, and reduce alcohol consumption.</narrative>
  </description>
